        "quote": "到分诊台时，请直接说"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00359",
        "explanation": "The plan was adapted to the caregiver's difficulty reading the prescription by arranging in-person review.",
        "quote": "明早可直接拿药盒和处方去社区卫生服务中心"
      }
    ]
  },
