          "quote": "先让他安静休息30分钟"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00135",
          "explanation": "The persistent repeat result was used to change the plan from observation to urgent assessment.",
          "quote": "且休息后未下降"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The uncertain home reading was repeated after rest, remained markedly elevated, and the doctor used that verification to escalate to same-day in-person assessment without delaying for further home checks.",
