          "quote": "明早可直接拿药盒和处方去社区卫生服务中心"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00373",
          "explanation": "The family demonstrated partial receipt but still reported fear of misreading the medication regimen.",
          "quote": "我现在人有点懵，就怕药吃错"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor categorized several pending threads and assigned timing and owners, but safe medication execution was not resolved and the final teach-back request was unanswered. Because minimum medication and final receipt duties were not securely completed, this cannot receive complete bounded-closure credit.",
